，同属于Gedeo区下，东部与Guji区接壤。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkD9fuZACPgTAJ2se9XpIibnIFs7c7QK18okFpXVZH0oRYZbiaxicDIlpsyIvn8Sca5bRRAPwxv8yibA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Gedeb区的小农的咖啡种植与生产历史相比耶加雪菲和科契尔就比较年轻了，都是仅1、2代人才开始，属于“新一代”埃塞咖农，也正是由于这股子年轻劲头，他们大胆的尝试新鲜的处理加工方式，可以对接国际市场动态变化的各种资源，很快便在国际市场打出了名头，像我们连续两年采购的Worka不论是水洗还是日晒都非常完整的代表了整个Gedeo区域的咖啡风味特征。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkD9fuZACPgTAJ2se9XpIibaJxsM343nFarMiapcOYf70IJn0ZODmvlrCfldYiaN3y1NUkibrkTO1jdQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;width: 578px;height: 367px;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Worka Chelbessa由Negusse Debela创立于2017年，服务周边的仅500户咖农；2019年Negusse在距离Chelbessa几公里外的一个叫做Danche的小区域建立了公司旗下的第二家处理站Danche。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n          关于\n          <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           Neguesse\n          </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           Debela\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;text-align: start;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           Neguesse Debela 进入咖啡行业的时间并不长，Neguesse在埃塞俄比亚被称为计算机专家，经营着一家成功的计算机部件进口公司。\n          </span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           咖啡似乎并不是首选的生意，Negusse是在去美国的明尼苏达州的一次旅行中，顿悟于当地的一家咖啡馆喝到一杯让他的人生发生彻底的转变的手冲咖啡，在那一刻，他意识他的祖国的咖啡的潜力，于是回国后他便彻底的走访了一圈埃塞南部的咖啡产区，了解学习咖啡的种植历史，种植处理与贸易情况，随后他找到了\n          </span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;\">\n           一位精力充沛的年轻咖啡专业人士\n           <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n            Abenezer Asafaw\n           </span>\n           ，雇佣他为他的品质和咖啡经理；Negusse成立了咖啡出\n          </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;\">\n           口\n          </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n            公司SNAP，购买了土地建立处理站，管理Nensebo、Gedeb和Guji区域多个处理站点。\n           </span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n            2019年，SANP更是建立了他们的干加工处理厂，实现了从种植、采收加工处理、出口脱壳一条龙的产业链，实现完全的管理和控制他们的咖啡产品和质量。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;text-align: start;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkD9fuZACPgTAJ2se9XpIibR25hR91ibVgSaNzH6z5DzOg7EiazD9icREiaqfibLdyzlG2ftUWcPvROa8Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡信请查询公众号文章板块～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝和有赞小程序可选购更多豆豆哈\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 678px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n</div>",
